      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL is calling `queue_flush()` without `STM32_USART_CR2_RTOEN` being checked.\n\nAs noted in my other comment, it\u0027s possible for these bits to get stuck if they don\u0027t fill a packet and the timer is not enabled.",
      "revId": "852d8f90a91f06f7755d8c78027d776384523479",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
